1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,999
[Music] My name is Swaminathan. I am from Kanyakumari Marthandam.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:22,999
I come from Kadayalmootti. I am a member of the Sacred Heart Church there. After receiving the Covenant materials,

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,999
including a Tamil newspaper and a book about the Marian Covenant, my youngest daughter Vijil

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,999
brought these to my house on the 23rd or 26th (date). After receiving the book and Covenant materials,

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,999
three days later, I had rice gruel for lunch. While drinking the gruel, after dissolving the Covenant salt in it,

6
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:55,999
I drank the gruel with the Covenant salt dissolved in it.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,999
After drinking this gruel, I noticed some changes in myself. Before consuming this Covenant salt,

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,999
there was no prayer in my house, nor did I go to church any day.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:17,999
There was no devotion. This was my situation. After drinking this salt gruel, some changes happened in me.

10
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:26,999
Without telling anyone, I started praying at 4:30 in the morning and at 8:00 at night. After that...

11
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:34,999
Every Sunday and Friday I would go to church. On the first Friday of every month, I would do confession.

12
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:41,999
This was how I was living. But when I started praying morning and evening, at the end of the prayer

13
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:48,999
I would say, "Gracious Kreupasanam Mother, please prepare a chance for me to kneel before your altar and pray."

14
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:57,999
I would end my prayer like that. After about ten months, in the middle of those months,

15
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:06,999
three illnesses were healed in me without my knowing. After these three illnesses were healed,

16
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:14,999
my love and faith in God grew twice as much. As a result,

17
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:25,999
on 24/12/23 I received the Covenant. After about 20 days of receiving the Covenant,

18
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:34,999
I had a vision. I saw two orphan women bathing in the river and coming into our church yard, then going to the back road.

19
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:40,999
They were rinsing water from their clothes. They had no clothes to wear.

20
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:47,999
When I saw this, I told my life partner what I had seen.

21
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:53,999
She said, “Even if we saw two people, let’s find clothes for three people.”

22
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:01,999
So we found clothes for two, but couldn’t find for the third person.

23
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:07,999
Then I said, “We can give clothes to a poor woman who works cleaning in a government hospital.”

24
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:13,999
This happened on a Friday morning. On the tenth day, on Saturday morning at 4:30 while praying,

25
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:22,999
my prayer suddenly stopped, and I felt like someone or something was telling me, "From where you are sitting..."

26
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:32,999
“If you stretch out your hand, you can see a person. If you turn from where you are sitting, you can see a person. With someone this close, why are you wandering here and there?” it asked.

27
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:38,999
I replied, “Anyway, the prayer shouldn’t stop. Let the prayer finish.”

28
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:46,999
Then it said, “After that, you can think.” So I kept praying as usual, finishing my prayer without any disturbance.

29
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:57,999
After prayer, I told my life partner. The two of us thought about it and found that person, then we gave clothes to all three of them.

30
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:04,999
Mother showed me the cloth with her eyes. That colored cloth is what we gave them.

31
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:10,999
After that, I renewed the Covenant here and went back home.

32
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:17,999
After returning home, I had severe toothache in this area, like water was entering the tooth. But

33
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:24,999
I had to use the Covenant items and apply the Gracious Oil. That day I had no thoughts about it, and for two or three days

34
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:31,999
I kept turning unknowingly, without realizing where I was sitting or moving around.

35
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:39,999
On the third day, Sunday morning, the church bell rang at 5 o’clock. Then I told my life partner,

36
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:46,999
“You go to church. I’m not coming. Even if I come, I can’t sit. The prayer shouldn’t be disturbed.”

37
00:04:47,000 --> 00:05:00,999
Saying this, I took the Gracious Oil, applied it here, held the cash-figure in my left hand, and lay down on the left side. I slept for about an hour.

38
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:07,999
When I opened my eyes and looked around, between my bed and my life partner’s bed, there was a cape three and a half or four feet long.

39
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:17,999
On the cape, there was a plastic chair, and I saw someone sitting on it. But I thought it was my life partner, so I asked,

40
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:30,999
“Why are you sitting here and not going to church? Why are you sitting here instead of church? The prayer is disturbed today. Because of you, it didn’t happen. If it was because of me, I would have come.”

41
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:42,999
But that person didn’t say anything to me. I opened my eyes fully and saw a dress. The dress was not the one my life partner gave me, but a different dress.

42
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:48,999
Then I felt that she had changed the dress given for church and was wearing another dress. I said,

43
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:52,999
“You changed the dress given for church and are sitting here. Because of this, I have a toothache. It’s not serious; it will heal when I go to the hospital.”

44
00:05:53,000 --> 00:06:05,999
“Why are you sitting here instead of going to church?” I asked again, but no answer.

45
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:11,999
Then I thought, “No matter what I say to you, you won’t listen. Do whatever you want.”

46
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:18,999
Then I opened my eyes a bit more and looked at the face. When I looked at the face...

47
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,999
What I saw was not my wife.

48
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:25,999
It was this mother who was sitting there.

49
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:32,999
This mother was sitting there looking like that. Then I said,

50
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:40,999
“Mother, I am a sinner who makes thousands of mistakes every day. Mother, I didn’t go to church today, and you came here to see me today, didn’t you?”

51
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:47,999
What I said to the sinner was told by my wife, my life partner.

52
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:54,999
The toothache got worse. Immediately tears ran down from both eyes. Then my life partner

53
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:02,999
asked, “Is the toothache why you are crying?” She said, “It’s 8 o’clock.

54
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:10,999
Isn’t it time to get some rest?” When I looked at the watch it was 7:45. Then I said,

55
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:17,999
“I was talking to mother when you came.” She said, “Did you see mother?

56
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:24,999
That is a great blessing indeed.” After that, she brought tea. After drinking tea, I said,

57
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:30,999
“I will not go to the hospital or anywhere. I don’t know how this toothache stopped.” Similarly,

58
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:39,999
urination was very painful. When I checked what it was, the doctor said I had a wound and gave me medicine.

59
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:46,999
He said the wound would heal if I took the medicine. That’s true. The wound would heal, but then

60
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:55,999
it would come back again and again. For three years I suffered a lot. After that, I started using the Covenant items here.

61
00:07:56,000 --> 00:08:11,999
I don’t know how the wound healed. It’s been just one year since I applied medicine, used the Covenant items, and the wound healed. That wound has not returned. Similarly,

62
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:18,999
on Friday, and then on the next Saturday morning at 4:30, while praying,

63
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:25,999
a cold breeze touched the back side of me near the lower back. I immediately looked at the candle.

64
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:31,999
I thought I should light the candle, but the candle wasn’t lighting; it was burning as usual. That coldness

65
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:39,999
went away. After a while, again a very strong cold breeze touched my lower back. Then I looked around and

66
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:46,999
wondered whether I should open the windows, but all windows were closed. That’s when I realized it was mother.

67
00:08:47,000 --> 00:09:00,999
Then my prayer stopped. Usually I watch for witnesses and share with everyone. That day, the prayer stopped and I went to lie down. After lying down for about 10 minutes,

68
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:07,999
I had a vision. I saw a sister whom I know. She is working in a convent called Arakkuval, Nagarcoil.

69
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:14,999
Her name is Rani. She was sitting close to me. Then I...

70
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:20,999
I asked the sister when she had come. She said, “I came some time ago. Why haven’t you noticed me?”

71
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:34,999
After saying that much, I replied, “I thought deeply in my mind — this is not the sister sitting there, it’s Mother.” I didn’t understand the rest of what she said. Then I asked,

72
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:47,999
“What is the sister saying? I don’t understand anything.” She said, “What I’m saying doesn’t make sense to you. You don’t understand why you don’t know.”

73
00:09:48,000 --> 00:10:02,999
I said, “I don’t understand anything.” Immediately she said, “I want your tongue.” I was confused and thought for a moment. Then I asked the sister,

74
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:09,999
“How do you want my tongue?” But my mouth was tied and shut. Then suddenly she grabbed my tongue and wiped saliva from it.

75
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:15,999
As she wiped it, I called out “Sister,” and looked back, but she was gone.

76
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:28,999
Then I thought carefully and realized I had a thyroid problem. On the third day, I got my thyroid checked, and the doctor said there was no thyroid illness at all.

77
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:38,999
So Mother had healed my thyroid problem. Similarly, my daughter — actually my son’s daughter — had health problems. She went to the hospital and got medicine,

78
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:48,999
but it wasn’t enough. I gave her salt and Gracious Oil, but that wasn’t enough either. One night while praying, I held her close,

79
00:10:49,000 --> 00:11:00,999
prayed, chanted for her, and told her to go lie down. The next day at 4:30 a.m., I prayed for her again and told her to rest.

80
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:11,999
Around noon, at 12 o’clock, she came crying and said, “Grandfather, I saw Mother Mary. I saw Mother Mary and was healed. I don’t have any pain now.”

81
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:17,999
Mother said, “Grandfather, take me to Mother Mary. That’s why I was healed.”

82
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:32,999
I said, “Whoever cared for your mother, I brought them along.” Like that, Mother and Jesus helped me in many ways.

83
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:39,999
Then about charity work: near my house, whether someone is important or ordinary, a stranger or familiar, if I know they are sick, I go there and pray,

84
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:46,999
whether it is night or day. I pray for about an hour there and then come back. Likewise,

85
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:55,999
I visit patients at three government hospitals — Arumanai, Pulacheri, and Marthandam government hospitals —

86
00:11:56,000 --> 00:12:06,999
distributing these newspapers to them and also bringing food. I bring food in rotation among these three hospitals.

87
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:16,999
Similarly, near Marthandam market, at about four or five places...

88
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:33,999
I have already seen the people — two who have both legs intact, a man and a woman, and two without legs. Then there is an elderly mother who has nothing left. I will not come without giving at least 50 rupees to anyone I meet like that.

89
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:48,999
Near my house, there is a woman named Leema who has cancer. She sold her house and land. Her husband, who had some illness, also died. Now they live in a rented house.

90
00:12:49,000 --> 00:13:08,999
They tell me, “Don’t pay rent; just stay here.” Because she has cancer, I visit her every month, pray there, and give her 500 rupees before coming back. That’s all I can say about myself, nothing more.

91
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:22,999
Similarly, about 22 rupees from my house, there is a man in Poor Billukari area who has two twisted legs and hands, and he is bedridden. Whenever I go there, I pray and give him 500 rupees before returning.

92
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:39,999
I pay all this money after riding the bus. Likewise, near my house there is an old lady. She is not that old, but she can’t see, has no teeth, can’t hear, and walks very slowly and with difficulty.

93
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:47,999
That lady is the one Mother showed me. But I thought she had passed away.

94
00:13:48,000 --> 00:14:05,999
Around Easter, when I was listening to the Daily Bread, Father said we should give to the poor and orphans, to those in the fields and to the weak.

95
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:13,999
That is the true Easter, the true Holy Week Easter. While living like that, Mother showed me that old lady in a vision.

96
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:25,999
When I went there, I saw her life was just like how I saw it in the vision. But she has no one to care for her. She has one daughter, but if the daughter goes to work, there is no one to look after her.

97
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:34,999
If someone watches over her, then the daughter can go to work. That’s how tough their situation is. When I go there, because she has no teeth, I take biscuits or fruits or something.

98
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:43,999
I give her 150, 200, or 300 rupees—whatever I have in my hand—and then come back. I do these charitable acts as I like.

99
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:50,999
For the rest of my life, my life will be in this Covenant. My life is the life of my Covenant until the end.

100
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:59,999
I end this by giving thanks to Jesus and Mother with millions of thanks.

101
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:11,999
Psalm 139, verse 5 says: “You hem me in behind and before, and you lay your hand upon me.”

102
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:18,999
This knowledge amazes me. It is beyond reach, it is exalted. — Swaminathan

103
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:29,999
This is his Covenant testimony, beautifully shared with us now about the great closeness of the Holy Mother.

104
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,999
This is the testimony. Before entering the Covenant life,

105
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:45,999
a friend gave him salt. On the third day, when the gruel had no salt left,

106
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:54,999
he started drinking gruel with the Gracious salt. He says that’s when changes began in his life. The Covenant items brought

107
00:15:55,000 --> 00:16:02,999
a great and significant change in his life. This is what we hear through this testimony. The Holy Mother’s appearance, closeness,

108
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:09,999
touch, healing, and intervention are the main content of this testimony.

109
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:16,999
As we know, the Gospel of Mark says that if salt loses its saltiness,

110
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:23,999
it is good for nothing but to be thrown out. The Gospel itself responds to us,

111
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:31,999
saying that we become seasoned by fire and by the Holy Spirit.

112
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:37,999
Jesus Himself answers us that if our saltiness is lost, our life is lost.

113
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:43,999
In all situations when we realize, “No one can help me anymore, my life condition is very bad,”

114
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:51,999
the Holy Spirit is the one who beautifies the condition of our life, the Gospel reminds us.

115
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:57,999
This same experience is what brought Swaminathan into the Covenant life.

116
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:04,999
He, along with his life partner, understood the interpretation of dreams.

117
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:12,999
The Holy Mother gave him great grace through Jesus to understand this.

118
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:19,999
The testimony says that through a significant dream interpretation,

119
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:25,999
he began acts of charity and missionary work as part of his life’s work.

120
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:30,999
Our dreams have meanings.

121
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:37,999
For those who have entered the Covenant, it is very common to have dreams and visions.

122
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:44,999
We should not dismiss them lightly. They all have meanings and interpretations. May we receive the grace to recognize this.

123
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:52,999
Likewise, decisions are always taken together by two persons about whom to help.

124
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:57,999
A special value of the Covenant life is making decisions with your life partner,

125
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:04,999
and being united with the family, always able to come together in family prayer.

126
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:09,999
This is a great grace we receive in the lifestyle of the Covenant life.

127
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:16,999
After entering the Covenant, all the life difficulties and health issues were dealt with through the use of the Covenant items.

128
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:24,999
He had a toothache, and after applying the oil there, he got some relief. When he fell asleep, the pain was taken away by the Mother herself,

129
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:30,999
he testifies. He experienced the closeness of the Mother many times. The manifestations in the Gracious Salt are now appearing

130
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:36,999
in families, individuals, circumstances, offices, and workplaces. Today, the Mother is appearing everywhere.

131
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:43,999
While a sister was speaking to him nearby, he wondered why the sister was talking there. When he looked back, in his discomfort,

132
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:49,999
the Holy Mother herself had come and comforted him, giving peace. He testifies this.

133
00:18:50,000 --> 00:19:03,999
Let us pray that the Holy Mother comes into each of our families, and that we receive the grace to experience her closeness.

134
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:08,999
When living through the Covenant, the Holy Mother intercedes in all matters. She is the Mother of time reduction —

135
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:14,999
she is the solution to all our problems and gives quick answers.

136
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:21,999
He tells about a little daughter who was unwell; the Holy Mother herself appeared and showed the child. The child testifies,

137
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:28,999
“I saw the Mother.” He came with all records —

138
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:34,999
all the records of his life’s wellness, thyroid, urinary infections, and toothache. This is not a myth or story;

139
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:40,999
through the intercession of the Holy Mother, Jesus gives complete healing, he testifies.

140
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:47,999
Let us thank Jesus and the Mother for all the blessings given to Swaminathan and his family.

141
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:54,999
Along with this, let us place all our appointments under the intercession of the Holy Mother.

142
00:19:55,000 --> 00:20:00,999
Let Jesus bless us and fill us with graces. It is time to place all our empty vessels here;

143
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:06,999
through the intercession of the Holy Mother, may they be filled with wine and our lives be filled with spiritual intoxication, we pray.

144
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:12,999
Thanking all the blessings and goodness received by Swaminathan and his family, let us give a big round of applause,

145
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:19,999
and offer the testimony to Jesus and the Mother. May extraordinary divine experiences be yours as well.

146
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:24,999
If you haven’t subscribed to this YouTube channel yet, please do so now.

147
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:29,000
Share this video with your friends and become a messenger of the Lord.
